	order_index: 9
	quest_links: [ ]
	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#19F220 to=#B4FFB0 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>瓶装知识！</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你携带的每个等级，都会在死亡瞬间消失。 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Cognition</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 将这个数值转化为真实资源。经验变成一种名为 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Cognitium</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的流体，而流体可以被储存、输送、消耗和回收。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>该模组自称是魔法与科技的结合。实际上，它只是一小套方块，都依附于一个核心部件——</grad><grad from=#9DB8D4 to=#5D7791 f=0.8>经验方尖碑</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，外加一系列让经验更易收集、更难丢失的物品。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 模组用 `points` 而非等级来衡量一切。一个等级并非固定点数，所以5级时的30等级和50级时的30等级是两个截然不同的堆。本章的成本以点数表示，括号内注明从零级升到该等级所需的点数。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>本章的走向</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>所有物品都将从最上方的这些</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>材料</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>中制作出来。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>方尖碑</grad><grad from=#9DB8D4 to=#5D7791 f=0.8>及其附属方块。用于存储、喷泉、解除诅咒等。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>分子变形者</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>，消耗储存的经验来改变物品的形态。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>底部那个 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Bibliophage</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 分支，这才是建造这一切的真正原因。一个能自我扩散的经验农场。"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>认知齿轮、奇物，以及能阻止死亡吞噬你等级的</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>记忆石板</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 如果这个模组里只建一样东西，就建记忆石板。它在章节很靠后，但能让你在本整合包里的每一次死亡都只付出走回原路的代价。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>二十个认知桶等于一点经验值。这个比例永远不会变，所以一个桶正好是五十点。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "experienceobelisk:experience_obelisk"
			id: "31AD328D0AFB4DE7"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 8
					id: "57397A5466D71886"
					item: "experienceobelisk:cognitive_flux"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "362A5DBB4148AFBB"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 25
				}
			]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 2.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#7ED47E to=#7ED47E>你的等级，但永久有效。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7A4C26541A32429B"
				title: "给我看看"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#19F220 to=#B4FFB0 f=0.6>认知</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["31AD328D0AFB4DE7"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>原始材料</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将一块 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>下界石英、一块 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>青金石和一块 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>灵魂沙或 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>灵魂土</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一起放入合成网格中。无需特定顺序，即可一次性获得 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>四块</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>纹流。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>单独的Flux本身毫无作用。它是炼制或培育其他一切事物的粉尘，所以应该成堆制作，而不是四个一组。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 废弃传送门箱子有超过一半的概率会携带 `4 到 20` 个 Flux。如果你在搜刮传送门，请在合成任何东西前检查你的箱子。"
			]
			id: "569AB8201C2EEEDA"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 8
					id: "5A578EADC11B54D1"
					item: "experienceobelisk:cognitive_flux"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "000088BE60246096"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 10
				}
			]
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#7ED47E to=#7ED47E>石英、青金石，还有一点灵魂沙。</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				count: 4L
				id: "547C00B731C4B140"
				item: { Count: 4, id: "experienceobelisk:cognitive_flux" }
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Cognitive Flux</grad></shadow>"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["569AB8201C2EEEDA"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>Cook The Flux</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在任何</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>熔炉</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>中熔炼纹石，或使用</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>高炉</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>可加快一倍速度。每个纹石会生成一个</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>合金块</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Amalgam 是本模组真正的基石。从今往后的几乎所有配方都会直接使用它，或者使用由它制成的物品，所以如果你打算大量建造，这一步是首先要自动化的。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>八个Amalgam围绕一块Glass可以制作出八个Whisperglass，这在章节后面还会出现。剩下的材料将用于接下来的两个任务。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "72ED150B587B6761"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 8
					id: "0191D5E701410972"
					item: "experienceobelisk:cognitive_amalgam"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "1CF0B41AD9C1B5EA"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 10
				}
			]
			size: 1.3d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#7ED47E to=#7ED47E>万物构成的基石。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				count: 8L
				id: "33F7CCE1D24C51D3"
				item: { Count: 8, id: "experienceobelisk:cognitive_amalgam" }
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>认知融合体</grad></shadow>"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["72ED150B587B6761"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>Amalgam Plus 铜</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>四个</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>合金块</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>呈十字形环绕一个</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>铜锭</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。每次合成一个合金块。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"合金是此模组的金属部分。机器框架、法杖、记忆石板和所有认知装备都需要它。它还能堆叠成一个可用作信标基座的存储方块。"
				""
				"[!note] 拥有 Molecular Metamorpher 后，配方会便宜很多。两个 Flux 和一个 Copper Ingot 只需 `16 points`，完全跳过 Amalgam 步骤。"
			]
			id: "63126208641E8A64"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 2
					id: "2F3F13843A2D8F58"
					item: "experienceobelisk:cognitive_alloy"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "29150A959E0309C3"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 15
				}
			]
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#9DB8D4 to=#9DB8D4>金属部分。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				count: 2L
				id: "6E93D2D2ADFF07FF"
				item: { Count: 2, id: "experienceobelisk:cognitive_alloy" }
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#9DB8D4 to=#5D7791 f=0.8>认知合金</grad></shadow>"
			x: 6.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["72ED150B587B6761"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>Amalgam Plus 祖母绿</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>与合金相同的形状，但中间镶嵌的是一块 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>绿宝石</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，而非铜。每次合成消耗一个水晶。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>水晶是</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>奥术的</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一面。它位于方尖碑顶部、法杖、护身符和书虫内部，也是变形者将其变为变形焦点的催化剂。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!note] 变形者版本需要2个Flux和1个Emerald，可获得`16 points`。无论哪种方式，Emerald都是瓶颈，所以村民交易所能自给自足。"
			]
			id: "77F6F6AF4D2CCACD"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 2
					id: "1A4DD1F6E8A3A169"
					item: "experienceobelisk:cognitive_crystal"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "353D5F30BDEAA979"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 15
				}
			]
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#7ED47E to=#7ED47E>神秘学部分。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				count: 2L
				id: "13AC9757F84A676A"
				item: { Count: 2, id: "experienceobelisk:cognitive_crystal" }
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>认知水晶</grad></shadow>"
			x: 6.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"63126208641E8A64"
				"77F6F6AF4D2CCACD"
			]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#19F220 to=#B4FFB0 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>模板</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将六块 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>认知合金</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>放在最外侧的两列，中间列的顶部和底部各放一块 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>红石</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，中心放一块 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>认知水晶</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。这样就能合成出 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>两个</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>了。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>The Astute Assembly 既是该模组的电路板，也是其 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>锻造模板</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。机器将其作为零件，锻造台则用它作为模板，将铁质齿轮和磨石转化为它们的认知版本。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 锻造会消耗模板。每把剑、每件护甲和精准驱散器，除了合金外，还需要消耗一个组件，所以多备几个备用。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>沙漠金字塔的宝箱约有三分之一概率含有一个，如果早期找到，就能免费领先一步了。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "4D55306979E35CD0"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 2
					id: "6A04BB566E3ABD0D"
					item: "experienceobelisk:astute_assembly"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "4EA6745BAC398ECB"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 25
				}
			]
			shape: "pentagon"
			size: 1.3d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#7ED47E to=#7ED47E>电路板和锻造模板。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				count: 2L
				id: "6873B7987DC25DA5"
				item: { Count: 2, id: "experienceobelisk:astute_assembly" }
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#19F220 to=#B4FFB0 f=0.6>精明组装</grad></shadow>"
			x: 8.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4D55306979E35CD0"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#19F220 to=#B4FFB0 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>核心组件</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>A </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Cognitive Crystal</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 放在顶部，下面放一个 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Cognitive Amalgam</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，最下面一排是 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Alloy</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Astute Assembly</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Alloy</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。放置后右键点击它。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>屏幕</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<c1>Two rows of buttons. </c1><c2>Store</c2> moves levels from you into the Obelisk, in steps of <c3>1</c3>, <c4>10</c4> or <c5>everything</c5>. <c2>Retrieve</c2> does the exact opposite. The number at the bottom is how many whole levels it currently holds, and hovering it shows the exact points."
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>小箭头打开 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>设置</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。在那里你可以调整真空的 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>半径</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，在 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>5</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 格之间以半格为单位递增，初始值为 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>2.5</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，并切换 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>红石信号</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 在忽略和启用之间。启用表示仅在供电时工作。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>它自己会做什么</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每半秒，它会吸干半径内所有的经验球。刷怪时站在它旁边，经验球就根本碰不到你，这正是喷泉和书虫出现后的理想状态。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它能容纳 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>5,000,000 积分，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>相当于从零起算的 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1,072 级。这比你任何时候能携带的都多，所以每个基地一个方尖碑就足够了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!success] 方尖碑的每侧都是一个普通流体储罐。Create、Mekanism、Thermal或其他任何管道都可以从中抽出Cognitium，或向其注入经验流体。Mob Grinding Utils XP、Thermal经验、Industrial Foregoing精华和Sophisticated XP在此均被视为经验。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>本章中其他机器都没有自己的储罐。它们都借用方尖碑的储罐，而这正是下一任务中法杖的用途。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "4EBDD061F42EECF2"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "044AEFA1C5FF3FFD"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 100
				}
				{
					exclude_from_claim_all: true
					id: "4166C03032CFF270"
					table_id: 4067690183644308744L
					type: "random"
				}
			]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.3d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#7ED47E to=#7ED47E>用于存储你等级的银行。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7D8407514BB5F7C9"
				item: "experienceobelisk:experience_obelisk"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#19F220 to=#B4FFB0 f=0.6>经验方尖碑</grad></shadow>"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4EBDD061F42EECF2"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>多功能工具</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>A </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Cognitive Amalgam</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 左上角，一个 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Cognitive Crystal</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 中间，和两个 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Alloy</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 在 Amalgam 正下方。形状像配方里的魔杖。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>消耗经验的机器没有自己的存储。法杖是用来告诉它们从哪个方尖碑中吸取经验的工具。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>逐步绑定，循序渐进</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>潜行并右键单击</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>方尖碑。法杖会记住它的位置。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>潜行并右键点击喷泉、驱散器或变形器。此时即已绑定。</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"3. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>再次潜行右键同一方块可取消绑定，或潜行右键空气使法杖忘记方尖碑。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 绑定范围直线距离为 `48 blocks`，且不能跨维度。请在方尖碑周围建造机器，而不是在基地的另一端建造。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>它能做的其他所有事情</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>右键点击</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>任意认知方块，询问它正在做什么。绑定机器会告诉你它们的方尖碑，书架会告诉你它们剩余的生命值。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>右键点击</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>加速器</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>可以旋转它。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>潜行右键点击加速器或被感染的书架，可切换其对红石的响应状态。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "5B5E37AE77ADAA11"
			min_width: 330
			rewards: [{
				id: "62E2AA4B3ED72E72"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 25
			}]
			size: 1.3d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#7ED47E to=#7ED47E>绑定、询问、旋转、切换。</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "338BAE146FE07F39"
				item: "experienceobelisk:attunement_staff"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Staff of Attunement</grad></shadow>"
			x: 12.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5B5E37AE77ADAA11"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>存储，已反转</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>A </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>中继器</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 放在顶部，然后是 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>合金块</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>投掷器</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>合金块</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 一行，接着是 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>合金块</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>精明组件</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>合金块</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 一行。用权杖将其绑定到方尖碑上，否则它将在那里无所事事。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一个受约束的喷泉将经验球向上喷出方尖碑。当它有 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>红石</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>信号，或者有 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>玩家站在上面时，它就会运行，这是附魔前提升等级的偷懒方法。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>四档速度</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>空手右键循环切换。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>缓慢</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，每秒4点。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>中等</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，每秒40点。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>快速</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，每秒400点。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>Hyper</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，每秒4000点。请勿无人看管地运行此项目。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>填充与清空</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用特定物品右键喷泉，可直接与方尖碑进行交易。 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>潜行</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>右键可一次性转换整个物品堆栈。 </grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>玻璃瓶</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 放入瓶中魔法，消耗 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>12.5 点</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，再将瓶中魔法放回方尖碑以返还消耗。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>金苹果</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>可兑换为附魔金苹果，价值 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>5,345 积分</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，相当于从零开始的 50 级。苹果可反向兑换全额退款，相当于随身携带 50 级经验值。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>桶</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>放入认知桶可获得 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>50 积分</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，再取回即可。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Forbidden Arcanus </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=##19F220 f=0.8>Xpetrified Orbs</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 熔炼可获得 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>91 积分</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 每个。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!note] 启迪护符默认会忽略喷泉喷出的球体，所以它不会把喷泉吸回房间另一头。不如站在喷泉的喷洒范围内。"
			]
			id: "652CB9296B0B8433"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 16
					id: "208F3B3958E1119D"
					item: "minecraft:glass_bottle"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "782D5D6F83662575"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 25
				}
			]
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#7ED47E to=#7ED47E>等级随你取用。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "41E57E8E86FE9CB2"
				item: "experienceobelisk:experience_fountain"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>经验喷泉</grad></shadow>"
			x: 12.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["652CB9296B0B8433"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>知识，物理层面</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在界定的喷泉中装满一桶水，你就获得了 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>50点经验值</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的液态经验。它会发光，你无法在其中溺水，也不会被它推开。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>由于它是真正的Forge流体，你现有的所有储罐和管道都可以输送它。用方尖碑的Create泵，Mekanism储罐作为溢流，Thermal电池作为储能。方尖碑反过来也接受其他模组的经验流体，并将其存储为Cognitium。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] Mob Grinding Utils 农场或 Thermal Centrifuge 本身就能将经验值转化为流体。直接将其接入 Obelisk，完全跳过球体阶段。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>每点二十毫升桶。一千毫升桶是五十点，从零算起是六级多一点。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "experienceobelisk:cognitium_bucket"
			id: "26F8C8E10F7FC978"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "4D735EDC4BF64FA7"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 25
			}]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#9BB7D4 to=#9BB7D4>可传输的经验值。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7580C82485E2695A"
				item: "experienceobelisk:cognitium_bucket"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.6>Cognitium</grad></shadow>"
			x: 12.0d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4EBDD061F42EECF2"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>会倾听的砂轮</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这是一个</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>锻造</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>配方。使用</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Astute Assembly</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>作为模板，</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Grindstone</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>作为基底，以及</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Cognitive Crystal</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>作为添加物。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>普通砂轮会一次性移除所有附魔，并且不会处理诅咒。而驱魔器则能让你从列表中</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>挑选一个</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>附魔，只移除这一个，并将该附魔所值的经验返还给你。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>诅咒</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>绑定和消失的效果也会解除，但需要消耗而非支付。移除诅咒需要消耗 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1,395 点</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，这相当于从零开始提升 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>30 级</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。在点击前，附魔的提示框会告诉你具体是哪一个诅咒。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!success] 将驱散者绑定到方尖碑上，它便完全停止接触你自己的层级。退款会流入方尖碑，诅咒费用则从其支出。"
				""
				"[!warn] 未绑定的退款将以光球形式掉落，诅咒费用将直接从你的经验条扣除。如果你的等级不足30级，诅咒将保留。"
			]
			id: "2B805115CE3F48E8"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "641A7BFAEDF6801B"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 50
				}
				{
					exclude_from_claim_all: true
					id: "3786B9A596A7D1EE"
					table_id: 4067690183644308744L
					type: "random"
				}
			]
			shape: "pentagon"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#7ED47E to=#7ED47E>移除一个附魔，不要全部移除。</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "3288B52481D05AA0"
				item: "experienceobelisk:precision_dispeller"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>精准驱散器</grad></shadow>"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 2.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4D55306979E35CD0"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>无水搬运物品</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>顶部放三个 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Cognitive Amalgam</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Amalgam</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Cognitive Crystal</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Amalgam</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，中间放一个，底部放三个 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Iron Ingots</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。你将得到 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>四个</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>加速器会将它前方单个方块内的物体朝其面对的方向推走。无论是球体、掉落物、生物，还是你。它主要存在是因为变形者的配方需要它，但它也是一个不错的球体传送器。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将普通的加速器单独放入合成网格中，即可得到 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>线性加速器</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，反之亦然。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>线性发射器会发射放置在其上的物品，并且只会水平旋转。</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8></grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>两者都可以通过右键法杖来旋转，也可以通过潜行右键来使其对红石敏感。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 一排指向方尖碑的加速器能将怪物农场里的所有球体吸进去，无需漏斗或流体管道。"
			]
			id: "2D2F8971015D57C0"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 2
					id: "0604E7DF04628643"
					item: "experienceobelisk:accelerator"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "60059C3828987D4C"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 20
				}
			]
			size: 1.15d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#7ED47E to=#7ED47E>推动它，发射它。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "249D3F47FF67AC09"
				item: {
