			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>加速器</grad></shadow>"
			x: 10.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2D2F8971015D57C0"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>比冰更滑溜</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>八个 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>玻璃 </grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>环绕一个 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>认知合金 </grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，用于换取 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>八个</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 低语玻璃。 </grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这是一种摩擦力被完全消除的玻璃。蓝冰本身就很滑，而这种玻璃比它还滑，所以加速器推到的任何东西在Whisperglass地板上都会持续滑动，直到被什么东西挡住为止。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>除了是很好的球体和物品追踪器外，它还是制作三种烧瓶的玻璃原料，所以即使你从不建造传送带，也需要准备几个。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "4C1F33A37F958841"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "623D16CA897140A8"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 15
			}]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#9BB7D4 to=#9BB7D4>无摩擦玻璃。</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				count: 8L
				id: "7676E7063073210A"
				item: { Count: 8, id: "experienceobelisk:whisperglass" }
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.6>Whisperglass</grad></shadow>"
			x: 10.0d
			y: -3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"2D2F8971015D57C0"
				"5B5E37AE77ADAA11"
			]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#19F220 to=#B4FFB0 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>消耗知识，获取物质</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>顶部一行：</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>水晶，</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>加速器，</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>水晶。中间一行：</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>合金，</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>水晶，</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>合金。底部一行：</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>精明组合，</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>锻造台，</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>精明组合。然后用法杖将其绑定到一个方尖碑上，因为它自己没有经验值。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>The Metamorpher 会向最多 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>三种</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 材料发射一束浓缩经验光束，将其转化为其他物品。每个配方都有以 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>点数</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 为单位的成本和加工时间，两者均显示在 JEI 中。绑定方尖碑的等级位于屏幕右下角，以便你看到其消耗进度。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>使用它</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>左侧有三个输入槽，右侧有一个输出槽。它会从你放入的物品中自动选择一个配方。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>锁</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>定按钮会记住当前的输入并拒绝其他任何输入，这正是漏斗所需要的。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>物品可从任意侧壁放入，并从底部取出。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>红石信号在启用前会被忽略，启用后仅在供电时运行。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>首批值得了解的配方</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>两份 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Flux</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 加一个铜锭可合成合金，两份 Flux 加一个绿宝石可合成晶体。 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>各16分，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 不涉及 Amalgam。 </grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>任意物品加一个 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>染料</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>会为其名称重新上色，可获得 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>315 积分</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。纯属外观效果，而且适用于任何物品。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 本章其余部分的所有重要物品都是 Metamorpher 配方。将其放在方尖碑旁边即可。"
			]
			id: "50CD9ED26DBA55C6"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "705CEFB4094848DD"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 100
				}
				{
					exclude_from_claim_all: true
					id: "00733132EA69A35F"
					table_id: 4067690183644308744L
					type: "random"
				}
			]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.3d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#7ED47E to=#7ED47E>由等级驱动的转换魔法。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "182B1B5EBD8BB7AE"
				item: "experienceobelisk:molecular_metamorpher"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#19F220 to=#B4FFB0 f=0.6>分子变形者</grad></shadow>"
			x: 14.5d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["50CD9ED26DBA55C6"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>催化剂</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Metamorpher 配方。一个 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Cognitive Crystal</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、四个 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Amethyst Shards</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和两个 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Nether Quartz</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，可获得 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>55 积分</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"焦点不会被消耗。它会作为催化剂放置在三个槽位中的一个，每次转换会损失 512 点耐久度，并解锁一系列“一进一出”的配方。它可以通过铁砧和书获得“不损坏”附魔，并且在配方中使用后会作为残留物留在网格中。将其锁定在槽位中，并用漏斗向另一个槽位供料。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>可解锁内容</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>The cheap ones, </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>16 points</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> each: </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>String</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> to Feather, </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Dried Kelp</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> to Leather, </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Rotten Flesh</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> to Dried Kelp, </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Sweet Berries</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> to Glow Berries, </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Ink Sac</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> to Glow Ink Sac, </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Sugar Cane</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> to Bamboo, </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Cobblestone</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> to Gravel, </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Quartz</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> to Flint, </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Moss</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> to Dirt, </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Leather</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> to Rabbit Hide.</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>The dirt ladder: Gravel to </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Sand</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> for </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>55</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>, Sand to </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Red Sand</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> for </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>160</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>, Red Sand to </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Clay</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> for </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>315</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>. Dirt to </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Grass</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> for </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>55</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>, Grass to </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Farmland</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> for </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>160</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>, Farmland to </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Podzol</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> for </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>315</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>.</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"昂贵的物品：将 <c1>可写之书</c1> 兑换成 <c2>命名牌</c2>，价格为 <c3>55</c3>；将 <c4>紫颂果</c4> 兑换成 <c5>紫颂花</c5>，价格为 <c6>315</c6>；将 <c7>紫晶块</c7> 兑换成 <c8>紫晶簇</c8>，价格为 <c9>1,395</c9>；将三个 <c10>下界合金废料</c10> 和三个金锭兑换成 <c11>下界合金锭</c11>，价格为 <c12>1,395</c12>；以及将 <c13>金苹果</c13> 兑换成 <c14>附魔金苹果</c14>，价格为 <c15>5,345</c15>。"
				""
				"[!note] 用废料合成的紫晶和下界合金是本整合包中重要的两种。它们原本都是有限的，但现在都取决于存储的等级。"
			]
			id: "11428F88DF5A6D45"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 8
					id: "6795D30A6AAD137A"
					item: "minecraft:amethyst_shard"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "725409A602424B80"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 30
				}
			]
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#7ED47E to=#7ED47E>一进一出。</grad>"
