		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"50CD9ED26DBA55C6"
				"23867C85CA873A5C"
			]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>尘埃，结晶化</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Metamorpher 配方。需要两个 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Cognitive Amalgam</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、四个 </grad><grad from=#C48CFF to=#7169A2 f=0.8>Forgotten Dust</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和五个 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Amethyst Shards</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，可获得 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>55 积分</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>被遗忘的尘埃是关键。它只产自腐烂破损的感染书架，或是堡垒图书馆和矿井宝箱，所以矩阵需要你已开启 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Bibliophage</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 分支。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>需要四样东西： </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>记忆石板</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>幸运护身符</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>修复神经凝胶</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 </grad><grad from=#C48CFF to=#7169A2 f=0.8>奢华琼脂</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。它们涵盖了本章的大部分内容，所以农场运行后，记得用粉尘喂养变形者。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "28472D6F2F48EE28"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "6573308C459AFA9A"
					item: "experienceobelisk:calcarine_matrix"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "7E61F38C9E117330"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 40
				}
			]
			size: 1.3d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#C48CFF to=#C48CFF>通往好物品的传送门。</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "409EF3B71C531B74"
				item: "experienceobelisk:calcarine_matrix"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C48CFF to=#7169A2 f=0.8>Calcarine Matrix</grad></shadow>"
			x: 20.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"28472D6F2F48EE28"
				"5041B0BFA02E6253"
			]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>无需铁砧即可修复物品</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Metamorpher 配方。一个 </grad><grad from=#C48CFF to=#7169A2 f=0.8>Calcarine Matrix</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和一个 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Fluorescent Jelly</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 可换取 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>四份</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> Neurogel，价值 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>315 点</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"在任意物品栏中，将神经凝胶拾取到光标上，然后点击损坏的物品。该物品会恢复320点耐久度或其最大耐久度的四分之一（取较高者），神经凝胶随即消失。认知装备的维修费用额外增加四分之一。"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一个神经凝胶在合成网格中分裂成四个 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>凝胶团</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，每个价值四分之一的修复量，四个凝胶团可合成回一个。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将其点击背包中的受损或破损的 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>铁砧</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，或右键已放置的铁砧，即可将其修复一个阶段。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 本整合包中的所有物品均可使用神经凝胶修复，除非模组将其标记为不可修复。它完全无视附魔成本曲线，这正是其精髓所在。"
			]
			id: "53FF24A5DE425417"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 4
					id: "2FCF0CA512DEF2F8"
					item: "experienceobelisk:mending_neurogel_blob"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "35BE9FD4F35B13EC"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 30
				}
			]
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#7ED47E to=#7ED47E>点击以修复。</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "114359663D8022B2"
				item: "experienceobelisk:mending_neurogel"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>修复神经凝胶</grad></shadow>"
			x: 20.0d
			y: -2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["28472D6F2F48EE28"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#19F220 to=#B4FFB0 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>死亡不再消耗等级</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"顶部是 <c1><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>合金</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>水晶</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>合金</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。中间是 <c1><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>金锭</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>附魔书</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>金锭</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。底部是一个 <c1><grad from=#C48CFF to=#7169A2 f=0.8>Calcarine 矩阵</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>按住潜行并右键单击</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>手持石板点击方尖碑，即可将自己与其绑定。每个方尖碑仅限一名玩家，且绑定关系在方尖碑被拾起和移动后依然有效。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>林克的所作所为</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在相连的方尖碑48格内右键，</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>无论你在哪里，都会打开其界面。更远的话，只会显示其位置。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>当你 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>死亡</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>时，你的经验值不会掉落。全部经验值会记录在你的名字旁边。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>下次你走进方尖碑的真空半径时，它会伴随着钟声返还每一个点。那部分不需要将石板放在背包里，只需要链接即可。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!danger] 方尖碑只能退还其能容纳的部分。五百万减去其已有物品的总和即为上限，所以不要把它装满然后在900级死亡。"
				""
				"[!success] 在一个单个首领就能抹去八十级进度的整合包里，这是本章最宝贵的物品。在制作任何其他闪亮物品之前，先制作它。"
			]
			icon_scale: 1.15d
			id: "1890C63932993CC5"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "376A7446A4261653"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 150
				}
				{
					exclude_from_claim_all: true
					id: "0FDB44A242A52ACE"
					table_id: 4067690183644308744L
					type: "random"
				}
			]
			shape: "star"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#7ED47E to=#7ED47E>你的等级回来了。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "2DAB85D4896BFD15"
				item: "experienceobelisk:memory_tablet"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#19F220 to=#B4FFB0 f=0.6>记忆石板</grad></shadow>"
			x: 22.0d
			y: -0.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["77F6F6AF4D2CCACD"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>脖子周围的真空地带</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用L形排列的三根 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>线</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，并在角落塞入一颗 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>认知水晶</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。廉价，有水晶后就能立刻制作。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"激活后，它会穿过墙壁，将8格内的所有经验球吸到你身边，并融合成一个球，这样你只需一帧就能吸收所有经验，而不是站在经验球的海洋里。手持物品，潜行右键切换，工具提示会显示当前状态。"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它在背包的任何位置都有效，并且可以放入</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>项链</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>栏位，这样就不用占用快捷栏了。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它会忽略经验喷泉产生的光球，这样你就可以在后面让喷泉一直运行，而不会获得经验。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它会从受感染的书架上收集球体，这究竟是功能还是麻烦，取决于你是否希望方尖碑拥有它们。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "5CF97444B5AFA286"
			rewards: [{
				id: "76B4984CBCD5D878"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 20
			}]
			shape: "diamond"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#9DB8D4 to=#9DB8D4>光球向你飞来。</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "74895CC0EEF34A16"
				item: "experienceobelisk:enlightened_amulet"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#9DB8D4 to=#5D7791 f=0.8>启迪护身符</grad></shadow>"
			x: 6.0d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4D55306979E35CD0"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>铁，已升级</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Smithing table. </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Astute Assembly</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 作为模板，任意 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>iron tool</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 作为基底，一个 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Cognitive Alloy</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 作为附加物。模板将被消耗掉。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>挖掘速度如钻石，打击力比原版强，耐久度为 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>921</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，附魔等级为 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>15</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。手持时还能对方块和实体提供 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+1 的攻击距离加成，这才是你真正会注意到的部分。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 挖掘等级保持在铁。认知镐无法破坏黑曜石或远古残骸，所以请准备好钻石镐。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>在本整合包的等级体系中，整套认知系列装备属于绿宝石级，因此其获取和平衡性均与其他绿宝石级装备一致。一个认知合金加一个燧石也能合成一个燧石与认知合金，其耐用性远超原版打火机。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "1219145C2379D908"
