		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4D55306979E35CD0"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>怪人帮</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>锻造配方相同，基础物品为原版 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>弓</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>钓鱼竿</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 或 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>剪刀</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>认知之弓</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>射出的箭矢速度提升 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>25%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，精准度提升 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>40%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，耐久度为 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>835</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。提示框会列出两项加成。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>认知之杖和认知之剪的行为与原版完全相同，但耐久度各为 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>2,200</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，并具有与原版工具相同的攻击距离加成。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "460CDAA713A6E76E"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "6F9BD1E4D2A31155"
				type: "xp"
