		{
			dependencies: ["28472D6F2F48EE28"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>幸运的升级</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"四个角放 <c1>四个金锭</c1>，边缘放 <c2>四个钙质基质</c2>，中间放你的 <c3>启迪护身符</c3>。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它保留了启蒙护身符的所有功能，并在激活时额外增加两项效果：永久性的 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>幸运 II</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，这会提升所有战利品表和钓鱼结果的概率，并增加怪物掉落给你的经验值倍数。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>掉落物为 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>20点或更少</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 时，数量翻倍。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在21和50之间掉落的东西会乘以1.6倍。</grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8></grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>更大的物品会乘以1.4倍。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 本整合包中的首领会掉落巨大的球体，所以首领的1.4远高于僵尸的2.0。在重要战斗中穿戴它。"
			]
			id: "7207564FDA28148F"
			rewards: [{
				id: "0A72DBE4F91968B3"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 50
			}]
			shape: "diamond"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#9DB8D4 to=#9DB8D4>幸运 II 和更多经验值。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "4D5BFE1EC7291586"
				item: "experienceobelisk:fortuitous_amulet"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#9DB8D4 to=#5D7791 f=0.8>机缘护身符</grad></shadow>"
			x: 22.0d
			y: 0.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["31AD328D0AFB4DE7"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>应对幻影的两种方式</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>白日梦之瓶</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。一瓶附魔、一朵蒲公英和一朵罂粟。喝下它，你的失眠将重置为零，这样幻象就会放过你三晚。你还会短暂地获得夜视能力。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>噩梦之瓶</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。一瓶附魔、一根扭曲或哭泣的藤条，以及一个扭曲或绯红的菌。喝下后，你的失眠会一次性加剧十天。几乎可以肯定，幻象会在第二天晚上出现，而且会让你短暂失明。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 恶梦的那个稍后再说。本章底部的奢华琼脂每块需要四个幻翼膜，这就是按需召唤幻翼的方法。"
			]
			id: "049CF8452AC9B6F2"
			optional: true
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 4
					id: "4C58C1C38C6A8D6B"
					item: "minecraft:experience_bottle"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "7C207121C836AB7C"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 15
				}
			]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#9BB7D4 to=#9BB7D4>睡觉，或者反过来的事。</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "4A96E2385CEC18B2"
				item: {
					Count: 1
					id: "itemfilters:or"
					tag: {
						items: [
							{
								Count: 1b
								id: "experienceobelisk:daydream_bottle"
								tag: {
									Damage: 0
								}
							}
							{
								Count: 1b
								id: "experienceobelisk:nightmare_bottle"
								tag: {
									Damage: 0
								}
							}
						]
					}
				}
				title: "任一瓶都可以"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.6>白日梦与噩梦</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6C8BC462702B425F"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#19F220 to=#B4FFB0 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>它们会吃掉书</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"在中间一列的顶部放置 <c1>Cognitive Crystal</c1>。其下方依次放置 <c2>Amalgam</c2>、<c2>Primordial Assembly</c2>、<c2>Amalgam</c2>。再下方依次放置 <c2>Amalgam</c2>、<c2>Nether Quartz</c2>、<c2>Amalgam</c2>。每个配方需要一个 Bibliophage，释放后即消耗掉。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>书虫是一种能将纸张消化成经验的小型机械生物。 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>右键点击任意书架，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>书架就会变成一个被感染的书架，它会缓慢滴下球体，蔓延至相邻书架，并最终碎裂。 </grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>有效目标</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- 书架标签中的任何书架，涵盖整合包中所有模组的每种木材变种。"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>模组自带的 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Archiver's</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Enchanted</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 书架，更耐用，售价更高。"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>荧光琼脂</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，经过四次感染后会变成营养琼脂，即所有这些的永久版本。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!success] 每个书架都不需要一个 Bibliophage。感染一排书架中的一个，感染就会自动蔓延到整排书架上。"
			]
			id: "48ECD4E9E75EC8C4"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 8
					id: "5705ABD03CBF41EA"
					item: "minecraft:bookshelf"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "7E4CE2353B76A060"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 100
				}
				{
					exclude_from_claim_all: true
					id: "5F9A219ABE00DB57"
					table_id: 4067690183644308744L
					type: "random"
				}
			]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.25d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#7ED47E to=#7ED47E>释放书虫们吧。</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				count: 2L
				id: "1B62FBD20D68A810"
				item: { Count: 2, id: "experienceobelisk:bibliophage" }
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#19F220 to=#B4FFB0 f=0.6>Bibliophage</grad></shadow>"
			x: 14.5d
			y: 3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["48ECD4E9E75EC8C4"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>书架是如何消亡的</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>受感染的书架就像一个生成器。它会随机延迟 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>300至500个游戏刻</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，然后吐出一个 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>12分</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的球体，接着再次延迟。在生成完 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>50个</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>球体后，它会耗尽能量并碎裂。也就是说，在大约十七分钟内，它能产生 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>600分</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的分数。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每秒还有 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>2%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的几率感染与其接触的书架。在书架密布的墙壁中，感染会迅速蔓延，因此一旦启动，农场就能自行运作。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>结果会是什么</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>范围内的任何方尖碑都会吸收这些光球。启迪护身符也能拾取它们。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C48CFF to=#7169A2 f=0.8>遗忘的尘埃</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，书架破碎时有50%的几率掉落，破坏书架时必定掉落。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>提前破坏书架也会掉落其中剩余的少量经验值，所以拆除农场不会造成任何损失。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!note] 右键书架并手持法杖可查看其剩余生命。潜行右键可将其设为红石控制，这样在供电前，球体和蔓延都会暂停。"
			]
			icon: "experienceobelisk:infected_bookshelf"
			id: "51E80E0758CFF02D"
			rewards: [{
				id: "24D183B7ED920FFA"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 50
			}]
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#7ED47E to=#7ED47E>六百积分，然后化为尘埃。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "16FF7004C5661492"
				observe_type: 0
				timer: 0L
				title: "看向一本被感染的书架 Infected Bookshelf"
				to_observe: "experienceobelisk:infected_bookshelf"
				type: "observation"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>受感染的书架</grad></shadow>"
			x: 14.5d
			y: 5.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["51E80E0758CFF02D"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>书架的两种升级方式</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>两者都使用原版书架的形状，上下各三块木板，中间的书本排列不同。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Archiver's Bookshelf</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 需要三本 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Written Books</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。被感染后，它能持续产生 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>100</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 个光球，共 12 点，即约半小时产生 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1,200 点</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>附魔书架</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>需要三本</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>附魔书</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。被感染后，它能承受</grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>100</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>个球体，每个</grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>24</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>点。每架书架</grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>2,400点</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，是普通书架的四倍。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它们也是用于附魔的合格书架。档案管理员书架可算作 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1.5</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>个书架，用于附魔台，而附魔的书架可算作 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>2</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>个，因此用一圈书架就能以更少的方块达到30级。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 书虫对皮革也更友好。三张纸和任意皮革可制作成书，任何模组的书架在合成台里都能变回普通书架。"
			]
			id: "7065A619B87F8F1D"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 6
					id: "4D4CCE629CD60D3A"
					item: "minecraft:book"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "1BE932F7B775C110"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 40
				}
			]
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#7ED47E to=#7ED47E>更长的生命，更大的球体。</grad>"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "7F9FAF82FF3468CC"
					item: "experienceobelisk:archivers_bookshelf"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "0283471CE4AB1594"
					item: "experienceobelisk:enchanted_bookshelf"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>Better Shelves</grad></shadow>"
			x: 14.5d
			y: 6.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["51E80E0758CFF02D"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>书架留下的东西</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一种像碎石一样落下的浅灰色沙子。碎裂的书架约有半概率掉落，破损的感染书架必定掉落，此外在</grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>要塞图书馆</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>中会以八到二十七堆的形式出现，或在矿井木箱中以较小的堆数出现。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它能作为熔炉燃料燃烧，九个可合成一个方块，但它的主要用途是作为材料。每个 </grad><grad from=#C48CFF to=#7169A2 f=0.8>Calcarine Matrix</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 需要四个，每个 </grad><grad from=#C48CFF to=#7169A2 f=0.8>Fluorescent Agar</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 也需要四个，这使得它成为本章下半部分的主要货币。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 粉尘不会穿过受感染的书架或琼脂。腐烂的墙壁会将其落到下方的方块上，因此农场下方的漏斗地板可以收集所有粉尘。"
			]
			id: "23867C85CA873A5C"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 8
					id: "2F6F77806E4B0FAA"
					item: "experienceobelisk:forgotten_dust"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "6F7190AA3636A222"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 30
				}
			]
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#C48CFF to=#C48CFF>知识的灰烬。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				count: 8L
				id: "6C737383498082FB"
				item: { Count: 8, id: "experienceobelisk:forgotten_dust" }
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C48CFF to=#7169A2 f=0.8>被遗忘的尘埃</grad></shadow>"
			x: 16.5d
			y: 5.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["23867C85CA873A5C"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7CF5A0 to=#C8FFD8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>培养皿</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>棋盘格。五个 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>荧光凝胶</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在角落和中心，四个 </grad><grad from=#C48CFF to=#7169A2 f=0.8>遗忘尘埃</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在边缘。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>琼脂本身是惰性的。它是一种等待接种的生长介质。 </grad><grad from=#8CFF8C to=#19F220 f=0.8>右键点击它四次，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>使用 Bibliophages，或者让它与其他受感染的方块接触以使其蔓延，它就会转化为 </grad><grad from=#C48CFF to=#7169A2 f=0.8>营养琼脂</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。用权杖右键点击它，可以查看转化进度。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!note] 四种感染体是永久书虫巢的全部代价。完成此任务后，你再也不需要为该农场制作食书虫了。"
			]
			id: "172C9DD0B3E1DDF6"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 5
					id: "460157511F922662"
					item: "experienceobelisk:experience_jelly"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "7A88FE4CCE74B9BC"
